WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Mix red paint with
white, and you get pink.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.520
You can never get the red back out.

3
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.930
Flowers seem to work the same way.

4
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.700
Cross a red four o'clock
plant with a white one,

5
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.890
and every offspring is pink.

6
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.480
But cross two of those pink plants,
and red and white flowers appear again.

7
00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:21.510
If pink were a simple mix, red
and white would be gone for good.

8
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.430
So why do they come back?

9
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:28.270
In this mission, you'll see how a heterozygote
can look different from both homozygotes.

10
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.750
Then you'll cross two heterozygotes
and predict every offspring,

11
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.330
step by step.

12
00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.080
Your mission: explain how pink parents
can have red and white offspring.
